  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Radius $\\leq 5$\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n\\sqrt{\\frac{\\lambda^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(1-\\lambda)^{2}}{4}-5} \\leq 5 \\Rightarrow \\lambda^{2}+(1-\\lambda)^{2}-20 \\leq 100 \\\\\r\n\r\n\\Rightarrow 2 \\lambda^{2}-2 \\lambda-119 \\leq 0 \\\\\r\n\r\n\\therefore \\frac{1-\\sqrt{239}}{2} \\leq \\lambda \\leq \\frac{1+\\sqrt{239}}{2} \\Rightarrow-7.2 \\leq \\lambda \\leq 8.2 \\\\\r\n\r\n\\quad(\\text { approx. }) \\\\\r\n\r\n\\therefore \\lambda=-7,-6,-5, \\ldots \\ldots .7,8, \\text { in all } 16\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\r\n\r\n$$ values",
    "image": null
